/- Source/core/bridge triage for Example 26.15:
- source-facing item kept here: weak existence and non-adaptedness for the sign SDE;
- core/canonical owners reused directly: `GeneralizedWeakSDESolution`,
  `oneDimensionalDiffusion`, and `oneDimensionalDrift`;
